<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8" />
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0"/>
  <title>Depot Location - D.D.C.A</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/css/clustering.css" />
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.css" />
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="navbar">
    <div class="nav-container">
      <div class="brand">D.D.C.A</div>
      <div class="nav-links">
        <a href="/home">Home</a>
        <a href="/AboutUs">About Us</a>
        <% if (!user) { %>
          <a href="/login">Login</a>
        <% } else { %>
          <a href="/logout">Logout</a>
        <% } %>
      </div>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <header class="hero">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <h1>SERA</h1>
      <p>Recommend depot locations from demand or hazard points around your area.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="scroll-section visible">
    <div class="content-box">
      <h2>How It Works</h2>
      <p>
        Default California points load automatically. Set a cluster count, run
        clustering, and SERA marks recommended depot centers on the map.
      </p>
      <ul>
        <li>Input points = demand / hazard locations</li>
        <li>Output = recommended depot centers</li>
        <li>Upload your own file anytime to replace the defaults</li>
      </ul>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="scroll-section visible">
    <div class="content-box">
      <h2>Your own data format</h2>
      <p>
        Use a <code>.json</code> array or <code>.csv</code> with headers.
        Required fields: <code>latitude</code>, <code>longitude</code>.
        Optional: <code>name</code>.
      </p>
      <pre class="format-example">{
  { "name": "Flood Zone - Stockton", "latitude": 37.9577, "longitude": -121.2908 }
]</pre>
      <p>
        CSV example header: <code>name,latitude,longitude</code>
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="scroll-section visible">
    <div class="content-box">
      <h2>Map and Clustering</h2>
      <input type="file" id="file-upload" accept=".json, .csv" />
      <div class="cluster-selection">
        <label for="num-clusters">Number of Depots:</label>
        <input type="number" id="num-clusters" value="3" min="1" max="10" />
        <button type="button" id="confirm-clusters">Confirm</button>
        <button type="button" id="start-clustering" style="display: none;">Run Clustering</button>
      </div>
      <p id="status-text">Loading default points...</p>
      <div id="map"></div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 D.D.C.A All rights reserved.</p>
  </footer>

  <script src="https://unpkg.com/leaflet@1.9.4/dist/leaflet.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/papaparse@5.3.2/papaparse.min.js"></script>
  <script src="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/@turf/turf@6/turf.min.js"></script>
  <script src="/js/clustering.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
